1
00:00:02,354 --> 00:00:03,400
As Uke punches

2
00:00:03,401 --> 00:00:05,078
slide in deeply behind him

3
00:00:05,379 --> 00:00:07,495
the other arm behind the back of the neck,

4
00:00:07,496 --> 00:00:10,393
cut down sharply
so Uke comes down in front of you,

5
00:00:10,394 --> 00:00:11,989
control the head and the wrist

6
00:00:11,990 --> 00:00:13,349
step in behind,

7
00:00:13,450 --> 00:00:14,790
turning Uke

8
00:00:15,091 --> 00:00:18,997
as you turn him around push and extend.

